#: doctor-subs.php
#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"Find and fix broken WooCommerce subscriptions. Detects ghost subs, "
"stuck-on-hold renewals, and repeated payment failures, with one-click "
"reversible fixes."
msgstr ""
"Vind en repareer kapotte WooCommerce-subscriptions. Detecteert ghost subs, "
"vastgezette on-hold verlengingen en herhaalde betalingsfouten, met één-klik "
"omkeerbare oplossingen."

